<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 27-day coupon T-bills Sept 25.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 27-day coupon T-bills Sept 25.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry offered a 27-day floater coupon T-bill issue at an auction on Wednesday, the central bank (BNB) said.</p>
<p>The ministry has set no par value for the issue and has offered it with no minimum acceptable price set in advance, a BNB statement said.</p>
<p>The coupon was set equal to the BNB's central interest rate (CIR) for the period to maturity.</p>
<p>The CIR was raised to 300 percent annually, in force from Tuesday, from 108 percent.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	BG 3018796022</p>
<p> Issue type	  floater coupon</p>
<p> Par value	     --</p>
<p> Auction date	Sept 25, 1996</p>
<p> Issue date	  Sept 26, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity	    Oct 23, 1996</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
</text>
